      "bottomRightX": 603,
      "bottomRightY": 352,
      "content": "$$h = \\pi m \\sum_ {0} ^ {\\infty} \\left[ | a (n + \\tau , n) | ^ {2} \\omega (n + \\tau , n) - | a (n, n - \\tau) | ^ {2} \\omega (n, n - \\tau) \\right] \\quad . \\tag {45}$$",
